          "format": "normal"
        },
        {
          "text": "While this unit is holding Ammo, gains increased ATK and attacks will cause bullets to bounce to nearby targets up to 5 times, dealing additional damage to 'Gelato Stops'",
          "format": "normal"
        },
        {
          "text": "First Form",
          "format": "title"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Light Unto Sufferers] Whenever a certain percentage of HP is lost, creates a permanent field effect. Enemies standing on affected tiles take reduced Physical and Arts damage and gain 50% Physical and Arts dodge",
