        {
          "text": "Second Form",
          "format": "title"
        },
        {
          "text": "After being defeated once, enters his Second Form, gaining increased ATK",
          "format": "normal"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Ashes to Ashes, Dust to Dust] Andoain stops attacking and scans the battlefield from left to right, locking onto at most 5 targets before dealing massive Physical damage to them and fully replenishing his Ammo",
          "format": "normal"
        },
        {
          "text": "Whenever a low percentage of HP is lost, unleashes the permanent terrain effect [Light Unto Sufferers]",
